### Prometheus Metrics
# Get Prometheus-formatted metrics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/metrics HTTP/1.1
Accept: text/plain

###

### Spider Execution Metrics
# Get metrics for spider executions
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###

### Request Rate Metrics
# Get request rate and throughput metrics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics/requests HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###

### Error Rate Metrics
# Get error rate and failure statistics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics/errors HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###

### Performance Metrics
# Get performance and latency metrics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics/performance HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###

### Queue Metrics
# Get queue depth and processing metrics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics/queue HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###

### Memory Usage Metrics
# Get memory and resource usage metrics
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/spider/metrics/memory HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

###
